<h1 data-copy-en="Joey" data-copy-zh="Joey">Joey</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Follow Joey’s current conversations and store-expansion route, including the stockroom conversation and per-night home visit." data-copy-zh="推进Joey当前交心及商店扩建路线，查找储藏室交心与每晚居家拜访条件。">Follow Joey’s current conversations and store-expansion route, including the stockroom conversation and per-night home visit.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Unlock_Limitation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Counter_Instinct"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Encounters_and_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Evening_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Late_Shift_Quiet_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Late_Shift_Quiet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Counter_Between_Us_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Counter_Between_Us"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Four_One-Time_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Katie's_Work_Introduction_and_Stock_Shelves"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Katie.27s_Work_Introduction_and_Stock_Shelves"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Joey — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/joey.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Joey — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/joey.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Joey — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Joey’s route includes six original-store scenes, three early heart-to-hearts and a later store expansion. The expanded shop adds a fourth conversation and a separate home invitation.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Her portrait is at Corner Convenience Store daily 07:00–23:00. The location keeps the same map position after expansion, when its displayed name becomes Bulk Goods Store. The later home invitation starts at Residential Block23:00–02:00.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the original-store scenes below. For Emily's Missed Call, first complete An Old Friend Walks In at the café interior 12:00–17:00 with Emily Friend 100 and Joey Known 25. The three early conversations proceed Late Shift Quiet → The Missing Years → No Counter Between Us.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Inventory Rush</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 10:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Regular</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Emily's Missed Call</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 10:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after An Old Friend Walks In</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Double Shift</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 16:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Inventory Rush</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Old Number</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after The Missing Years</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Late-Shift Light</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 21:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after Old Number / Stargazing Date with Joey / No Counter Between Us</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Bigger Picture</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 07:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Late-Shift Light / Double Shift / The Regular / Fair Date with Joey / Boardwalk Sunset with Joey / A Prize for Joey / Joey Puts You to Work / Three Girls Discussion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Room to Grow</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Corner Convenience Store; 07:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Commissioning the Bulk Goods Store</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Late Shift Quiet</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Friend (100); 20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Missing Years</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Close Friend (200); after Emily's Missed Call / Late Shift Quiet; 19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">75 min; 20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Counter Between Us</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Crush (400); after The Missing Years; 20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Little Privacy</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; after Room to Grow</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Bigger Picture requires the late-shift, double-shift and regular-customer scenes; Fair, Boardwalk and Voucher dates; Katie’s work introduction; and Three Girls Discussion. That discussion occurs in the store 09:00–17:00 when Emily, Rachel and Mindy are each Known 25.</p><p>After that proposal, commission Diane’s expansion for $10,000,000/180 min; the commission itself accepts Stranger 0 with Diane. Return to the store 07:00–23:00 for Room to Grow.</p><p>Then start A Little Privacy from Joey’s main shop portrait:60 min/15 Energy, no money, once. The scene takes place in the stockroom, but its action is in the main store. Romantic 800 plus that conversation and the completed expansion opens Visit Joey,60 min/30 Energy, once per night 23:00–02:00. Crossing midnight does not reset the same night’s allowance.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Interactions_and_Reading_People_Lesson"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 4/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Perfume</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Perfume</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Reading People</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Known (25); Communication 35</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">150 min; 35 Energy; 20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+10 base affection; learn Reading People once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Counter Instinct</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Friend (100); Communication 45</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">45 min; requires 12 Energy and 5 Calm available. Energy and Calm are not spent.</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 direct affection; Perception +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Friend (100); 11:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $150; 45 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Friend (100); 12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; 1 Voucher</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk Sunset Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Close Friend (200); Diane’s boardwalk completed; 17:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $80; 35 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stargazing Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Corner Convenience Store; Crush (400); 19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">150 min; $30; 30 Energy; restores 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Visit Joey</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Romantic (800); after Commissioning the Bulk Goods Store / A Little Privacy; 23:00–01:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once per night; affection follows conversation choices</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Learn Reading People needs Known 25/Communication 35:150 min/35 Energy/20 Calm,10 base affection, learned once. Counter Instinct requires Friend (100), Communication 45, and 12 Energy and 5 Calm available. It takes 45 minutes and grants 8 direct affection and Perception +1 once; Energy and Calm are not deducted.</p><p>The expanded store sells its supply items in 10-packs for 5 min or 100-packs for 10 min at standard per-item prices. Purchases are separate from Joey affection; chocolate theft stops after expansion. Stock Shelves remains a separate job,07:00–23:00, Stamina 10,60 min/25 Energy/10 Calm, not a friendship reward.</p><p>Crush 400 also allows the separate venue invitations 20:00–23:00:KTV 120 min/$150/40 Energy; Night Club 120 min/$100/30 Energy with its supporter prompt. Each venue shares one daily allowance across invited NPCs.</p><p>Favorite stats are Communication, Charm, Ability. Learning Reading People improves the relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Missing_Years_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Missing_Years"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>For The Missing Years, finish Emily's Missed Call and the first heart-to-heart, then return 19:00–23:00 at Close Friend 200.</li><li>For the expansion proposal, check the original dates and tutorial endpoints as well as affection.</li><li>Start A Little Privacy from the main shop, and the home visit from the Residential Block after 23:00. Neither is an extra late shop portrait.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-emily.html">Emily and the café scene</a></li><li><a href="character-katie.html">Katie’s work tutorial</a></li><li><a href="character-diane.html">Diane’s construction</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Venue invitations and relationship bonuses</a></li><li><a href="walkthrough-wealth-guide.html">Income and supplies</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Unlock_Limitation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Counter_Instinct"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Encounters_and_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Evening_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Late_Shift_Quiet_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Late_Shift_Quiet"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Counter_Between_Us_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Counter_Between_Us"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Four_One-Time_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Katie's_Work_Introduction_and_Stock_Shelves"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Katie.27s_Work_Introduction_and_Stock_Shelves"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Joey 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/joey.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Joey 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/joey.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Joey 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Joey路线包含六段原商店事件、三次早期交心及后续扩建。扩建后有第四次交心和独立居家邀约。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>普通头像每天07:00–23:00位于街角便利店。扩建后地图位置不变，显示名改为大包装商店。之后的居家邀约从住宅街区23:00–次日02:00开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>按下表推进原商店事件。Emily的未接来电需要先在咖啡馆内12:00–17:00完成老朋友走了进来，要求Emily朋友100、Joey已知25。三次早期交心依次为晚班的片刻宁静→失踪的岁月→我们之间没有柜台。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">库存冲刺</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；10:00–19:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">老熟客</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50好感）</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Emily的未接来电</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；10:00–20:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100好感）；完成：老朋友走了进来</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">双班</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；16:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：库存冲刺</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">旧号码</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；18:00–22:59</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400好感）；完成：失踪的岁月</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">晚班灯光</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；21:00–22:59</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800好感）；完成：旧号码、和 Joey 的观星约会、我们之间没有柜台</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更大的蓝图</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；07:00–22:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：晚班灯光、双班、老熟客、与 Joey 的嘉年华约会、和Joey在栈道看日落、给Joey的奖品、Joey 给你派活儿、三个女孩的讨论</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">成长的空间</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">街角便利店；07:00–22:59</td><td data-label="条件">完成：委托扩建大包装商店</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">晚班的片刻宁静</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；朋友（100好感）；20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">失踪的岁月</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；亲密朋友（200好感）；完成：Emily的未接来电、晚班的片刻宁静；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">75分钟；20精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我们之间没有柜台</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；迷恋（400好感）；完成：失踪的岁月；20:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一点独处时间</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；完成：成长的空间</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>更大的蓝图要求晚班灯光、双班及老熟客，游园会约会、木板路日落约会、替她赢个奖品，Katie工作介绍，以及三个女孩的讨论。后者在商店09:00–17:00触发，要求Emily、Rachel、Mindy均达到已知25。</p><p>提议完成后，向Diane委托扩建，$10,000,000、180分钟；该委托本身对Diane仅要求陌生人0。之后于07:00–23:00返回商店触发成长的空间。</p><p>接着从Joey的主商店头像开始一点独处时间，60分钟、15精力、不收费，仅一次。事件发生在储藏室，但行动在主商店菜单。浪漫感800、该交心及扩建完成后，可在23:00–次日02:00进行探望Joey，60分钟、30精力，每晚一次；午夜不会刷新同一晚的额度。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Interactions_and_Reading_People_Lesson"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天4次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送香水</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；已知（25好感）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">10分钟；香水×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+8；每天2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习识人术</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；已知（25好感）；沟通35</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">150分钟；35精力；20镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+10；学习识人术，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">柜台直觉</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；朋友（100好感）；沟通45</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">45分钟；开始时需有12精力、5镇定，两者均不扣除。</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">直接好感+8；感知+1；仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；朋友（100好感）；11:00–14:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$150；45精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；朋友（100好感）；12:00–17:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">木板路日落约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；亲密朋友（200好感）；Diane已完成木板路建设；17:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$80；35精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">观星约会</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">街角便利店；迷恋（400好感）；19:00–22:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">150分钟；$30；30精力；恢复10镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">探望Joey</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">浪漫感（800好感）；完成：委托扩建大包装商店、一点独处时间；23:00–01:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">每晚一次；好感按对话选择结算</td></tr></tbody></table><p>学习识人术要求已知25、沟通35，150分钟、35精力、20镇定，增加10基础好感，学习一次。柜台直觉要求朋友100、沟通45，并备有12精力、5镇定。课程消耗45分钟，一次性增加8直接好感和1感知，但不扣除精力或镇定。</p><p>扩建商店提供10件装、5分钟及100件装、10分钟的补给购买，按通常单价计费；购买不会增加Joey好感，扩建后不再提供偷巧克力。理货仍是独立工作，07:00–23:00、耐力10，60分钟、25精力、10镇定，不是友谊奖励。</p><p>迷恋400另可在场所20:00–23:00使用独立邀请：KTV为120分钟、$150、40精力；夜店为120分钟、$100、30精力，另需其赞助者权限。每个场所共用每天一次额度。</p><p>偏好的属性为沟通、魅力、能力。学会识人术可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Missing_Years_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Missing_Years"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>失踪的岁月需要Emily的未接来电及首次交心完成，再于亲密朋友200、19:00–23:00返回。</li><li>扩建提议除好感外，还要检查原商店约会与教程端点。</li><li>储藏室交心从主商店开始，居家拜访则在23:00后从住宅区开始，两者都不是额外的深夜商店头像。</li></ul></section>
